RomMulus — NOTICE (Linux x86_64 package)
=========================================

This package bundles the components listed below. Full license texts are in
this directory (share/licenses/rommulus/): libretro.txt (Libretro API),
third_party_license_metadata and third_party_licenses (Java dependency list).
Per-core provenance (exact upstream commit, vendored source subset, patches,
compiler/flags, checksums) is recorded in share/rommulus/core-manifest.json.

1. RomMulus application (desktop app, player, launcher)
   License: GNU GPL v3 (see LICENSE at the root of the source repository,
   https://github.com/romm-android-tv/rommulus).

2. OpenJDK 17 JVM runtime (lib/runtime/, produced with jlink)
   License: GPL v2 with the Classpath Exception (OpenJDK / Eclipse Temurin
   build). See lib/runtime/legal/ inside the bundled image for per-module
   attributions.

3. SDL3 (Simple DirectMedia Layer) 3.4.14 — used by rommulus-player
   License: zlib license. https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL

4. libglvnd 1.7.0 (libGLESv2.so.2 and libGLdispatch.so.0) — OpenGL ES
   dispatch libraries used by rommulus-player
   License: MIT. See libglvnd.txt.

5. Libretro cores (lib/rommulus/cores/), each a separately-licensed,
   dynamically-loaded shared object. Effective licenses:
