6. libretro-common (vendored helper sources inside the cores above)
   License: MIT (per file header). See libretro.txt for the Libretro API notice.

7. Java libraries inside lib/rommulus/app.jar (Compose Multiplatform, OkHttp,
   SQLite JDBC, JInput, zxing, commons-compress, XZ for Java, and others)
   Licenses: see third_party_license_metadata / third_party_licenses in this
   directory (Apache-2.0 bundle list).

No firmware/BIOS is bundled. Where a core requires BIOS (e.g. pcsx_rearmed),
the user must supply the files themselves; they are listed in
share/rommulus/core-manifest.json under "requiredFirmware".
